ffected. SEAM GAP RECORDED: host_transitional_ci_slot_count reads `data transitional_ci_slots` directly with no `_over` supplied-rows seam (unlike host_runner_pool_charge_over), so the count/charge/projected-wall all derive from one usable-RAM term and no witness can perturb the transitional count independently; the fail_closed red control is therefore driven through the authored-slot _over seam (srv1_authored_charge_inflation_refuses_at_the_admitted_total), which inflates srv1's charge at its production total and is asserted as a refusal.",
